    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_897_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I feel like I'm a kid in a classroom, having a science lesson for the first time. It's no hyperbole at all to say that 'science is the future of Columbia.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jackson"
    },
    {
        "text": "I regret not being able to stay longer and hear about your other projects.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jackson"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_893_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are always welcome at Rhine Lab, Mr. Jackson.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jara"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_897_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you, Director Jara. I hope my visit didn't cause too much inconvenience.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jackson"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_893_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kind of you to say so. It was a pleasure to be your tour guide today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jara"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_897_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Having the famous Marianne Blake as a tour guide alone makes this trip to Trimounts worthwhile.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jackson"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_897_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Between the two of us, I'm a pretty big fan of yours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jackson"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_897_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have an autographed poster of your debut film on the office wall.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jackson"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_893_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Really?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jara"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_897_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A present from my wife when I was elected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jackson"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kindly make a note to follow up with the special district government about Rhine Lab's application for a new research facility.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jackson"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Will do, sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vice President's Secretary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_897_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess that will be it for today, Miss Jara.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jackson"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_893_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wish you a pleasant stay at Trimounts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jara"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_897_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jackson"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_897_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jackson"
    },
    {
        "text": "May the sun shine on the next day, as it has today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jackson"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
