    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "I got the map you sent, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So there's a secret passage that leads right to the underground structure, but it's not in the plans that Muelsyse gave you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Leave it to me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been sitting here twiddling my thumbs while you and Rosmontis have fun with the power armor up there. Didn't even see a shadow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Saria is coming for me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I have to go to the underground structure too. The Vice President is leaving in a few minutes, right? We can't take any risks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) Ifrit moving out, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
