    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "-200,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "How are things up there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not sure. I didn't quite make it up to the surface, but there was no commotion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent A"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm guessing the attack failed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "We activated the jammers and aren't supporting any other units... I don't think anyone is coming here. Ferdinand's route was very well-concealed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's carry out the plan. It's almost time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent A"
    },
    {
        "text": "The explosives?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Set up while you were scouting... two tubes of advanced plastic explosives, enough to breach the containment structure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent B"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know, I thought Ferdinand wanted to come back to Rhine Lab. But this is the liquified Originium pipeline used by his Energy Section.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Colonel says he's stuck in the same boat as us. He has no choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't really see the point of blowing this up now, though...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent B"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Vice President should have left Rhine Lab by now. What good will blowing up the Originium pipes in the underground structure do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Colonel has his plans. All we need to do is follow orders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "n"
    },
