    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "29_g11_monitoringroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$m_bat_imprisonment_intro",
        "key": "$m_bat_imprisonment_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_899_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We lost contact with all units?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blake"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, sir. Sudden comms failure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Columbian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Vice President and his retinue, the press... no sign that anything is amiss. Looks like our guys were neutralized before they could move.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Columbian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reports indicate that our operations within Rhine are also being disrupted by the sudden appearance of some power armor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Columbian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_899_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blake"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're also losing signal from the cameras on the streets.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Columbian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're losing control of the scene, sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Columbian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_899_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blake"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, our best laid plans are like a sieve to the intelligence network of the Maylander Foundation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blake"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not surprising that they're able to respond, given how hastily this assassination plan was hatched.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blake"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Should we pull out, sir?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Columbian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're bound to trace the trail back here, sooner or later.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Columbian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_899_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No hurry...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blake"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Vice President said he would like to 'have a nice chat with top researchers.' I intend to oblige him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blake"
    },
    {
        "text": "Situation at C1 and C2?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blake"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Still in position. Signal stable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Columbian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_899_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Activate the remote control on the top-right of the panel, Riker.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blake"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Columbian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The remote control Blake referred to is a mundane mechanical button, fitted with an old-fashioned safety lock."
    },
    {
        "text": "The soldier enters the password, and the cover pops open, revealing the red button."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_899_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is this, sir?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Columbian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_899_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remote control for the explosives that will blow up the containment around the liquified Originium pipes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blake"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Columbian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_899_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look at the screen. According to the routes that Ferdinand provided, the Energy Section has several liquified Originium pipelines running through the west wing of Rhine Lab.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blake"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_899_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhine Lab Engineering does a thorough job.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blake"
    },
    {
        "text": "In addition to standard safety measures, there are also underground containment structures that prevent chain reactions in the event of a leak.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blake"
    },
    {
        "text": "The original plan was to cause a leak with an explosion, creating a chance for operatives on the ground to approach Jackson.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blake"
    },
    {
        "text": "By chance, however, Jackson's convoy will cross over one of these pipelines on the way back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blake"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_cherunder_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're Rhine Lab staff?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent A"
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard the Defense Section has a lot of bad-tempered people, but I'm surprised they would hire a kid so young.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I told you to surrender. I didn't say you could talk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll try to short stop of turning you to ashes. The Doctor and Saria may want to question you, after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, is that a flamethrower?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop! There are liquified Originium pipes all around us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So that's what's going on...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovementsp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "action": "zoom",
        "poszoom": "0.5,0.55",
        "scale": 1.1,
        "duration": 0.2,
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_fastener"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral",
        "delay": 0.5,
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown1",
        "delay": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The flaming-red Savra girl makes her decision in a split second. She re-engages the flamethrower's safety lock, and swings it hard at the one on the left."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_punch"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then she charges towards the one on the right, and catches the side of his face with her fist."
    },
    {
        "text": "In the time it takes for a flame to flicker, Ifrit is back on her two feet again, dusting off her palms."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Grgh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent A"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think my nose is broken...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Run, kid...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agent B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_devicebeep"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's that sound?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Damn, he started the countdown...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Less than one minute left\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_explosion_stone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_rockfall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_899_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "29_g11_monitoringroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can C1 and C2 make it back?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Columbian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_899_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Their contributions will be remembered, as well all others who give their lives this day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blake"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But Colonel... it's an entire convoy. Five cars, a dozen people in the retinue, possibly even Rhine staff members and reporters, and other passersby...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Columbian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_899_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have your orders, Riker.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blake"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Columbian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_899_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll hit the switch myself. That's my job. Your job is to report as soon as you get a signal from C1 and C2.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blake"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't defend myself if I stand trial for this someday.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blake"
    },
    {
        "text": "So I'm not going to waste my time explaining myself to my soldiers now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blake"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Columbian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_explo_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_901_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have the signal!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Columbian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Vice President's convoy is reaching the target area on the west side of Rhine Lab.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Columbian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Colonel?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Columbian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_899_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blake"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blake places his hand on the cold mechanical button. A chill runs up his finger, and he pauses for a couple of seconds."
    },
    {
        "text": "The soldier glances at his superior officer, whose brow is furrowed behind his sunglasses."
    },
    {
        "text": "The soldier realizes that his commander is even more anxious than he is."
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_899_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) Damn it all to hell!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blake"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "fadetime": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_button"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Blake presses the button."
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no sound, only an explosion on some of the screens."
    },
    {
        "text": "On the tiny screen, the collapsing streets were like foam boards underneath bubbling flame. Then the screen goes black, the camera destroyed by flying debris."
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no sound, but Blake and the soldier could hear the deafening boom in their heads."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_black",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#9$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "text": "The surface should be close, but I can't see the path with all these stone slabs in the way...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, are you two okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 25,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_explo_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh no, a chain explosion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Ifrit?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$calm_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "Ifrit hears a familiar voice through the echoes of the explosion and the falling rubble."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Saria? I'm here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hear you... hang in there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saria"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have a lock!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_surfacefrozen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ifrit can hear Saria's voice shaking. Something touches her fingertips in the darkness. Calcium crystals? Saria's Originium Arts."
    },
    {
        "text": "Like a stream of water, the crystals fill the gaps in the rubble, then expand, releasing a sickening crack\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "Saria has forced an opening in the collapsed structure."
    },
    {
        "text": "A hand reaches down from above. Ifrit grabs it and feels it pull her up, while the calcium tunnel shatters behind her."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_rockfall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
