    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 10,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#6$1",
        "posfrom": "-50,-150",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_896_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't move.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine, just a little dusty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_896_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your face... were you crying?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I wasn't crying! Just a little anxious, that's all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_896_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your hands are dusty too, Saria. You're making my face even dirtier.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_896_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, sorry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_896_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "And these two?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "They were the ones who planted the bomb that blew up the liquified Originium pipelines, so I brought them out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I couldn't stop the explosion...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_896_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You did well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_896_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You really did.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_895_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ifrit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_896_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it, Ifrit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
